        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Class Methods",
            "id": 127494,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le classi possono avere anche funzioni, chiamate <strong>metodi</strong> quando si trovano all'interno di una classe. Come il metodo <code>bark()</code> qui.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rocky = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.bark()\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Bark\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Class Methods",
            "id": 127499,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per chiamare un metodo di istanza in Swift, devi usare i punti. Ad esempio, con <code>rocky.bark()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"bark\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bark&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rocky = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(rocky.color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"rocky.bark()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"128\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"134\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Bark\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>rocky</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>bark</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 127500,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale affermazione è vera riguardo alla definizione di una classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Puoi creare metodi e proprietà nella definizione di una classe</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Puoi creare proprietà solo nella definizione di una classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Puoi creare metodi e proprietà nella definizione di una classe.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 127501,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come accediamo al metodo <code>printColor()</code> di <code>rocky</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Dog\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"printColor\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rocky = \" /><text value=\"Dog\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>rocky.printColor()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>printColor(rocky)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>rocky.printColor()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 127502,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale dei seguenti è il modo corretto per accedere alla variabile <code>color</code> di <code>rocky</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Dog\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"printColor\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(color)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rocky = \" /><text value=\"Dog\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>rocky.color</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>rocky.color()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>rocky.color</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 127504,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Definisci un metodo di classe chiamato <code>introduce</code> all'interno della classe Pokemon.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pikachu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"introduce\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>func</code>, seguito da <code>introduce</code> e poi <code>()</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 127505,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa l'istruzione di visualizzazione che mostra la variabile <code>name</code> codificando <code>name</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pikachu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"introduce\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"102\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 127506,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accedi e chiama il metodo <code>introduce</code> usando l'istanza della classe <code>pikachu</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pikachu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"func\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"introduce\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hi!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;I am &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pikachu = \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pikachu.introduce()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"141\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"142\" /><option startIndex=\"142\" endIndex=\"151\" /><option startIndex=\"151\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"152\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hi!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"I am pikachu\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pikachu</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>introduce</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
